secondaryOutcomes.description:
TCM symptoms changes are according to the lung cancer symptom classification quantization table in "Guiding Principles for Clinical Research of Traditional Chinese Medicine in the Treatment of Lung Cancer (2002 Edition)".

1. Significant improvement: clinical syndrome scores decreased by≥ 70%.
2. Partial improvement: clinical syndrome scores decreased b≥30%;
3. No improvement: clinical syndrome scores no change, or change\<30%;
4. Exacerbation: clinical syndrome scores increases by≥30%.
